WEBVTT

01:35.900 --> 01:40.770
[Fated Hearts]

01:41.490 --> 01:43.960
[Episode 23]

01:52.070 --> 01:52.729
Feng Suige.

01:53.120 --> 01:54.620
Since you know everything now,

01:54.620 --> 01:55.280
you should understand

01:55.280 --> 01:57.000
that what I've done
has nothing to do with my father.

01:57.000 --> 01:58.259
My father is innocent!

01:58.400 --> 01:59.930
Tell Fu Yixiao to let him go.

02:00.760 --> 02:02.220
This is between you and me.

02:02.430 --> 02:04.030
Don't drag my father into it.

02:18.720 --> 02:20.720
Elder Marquis Murong is in my hands!

02:20.750 --> 02:21.710
Whether or not he gets released

02:21.710 --> 02:22.840
is entirely up to me.

02:23.190 --> 02:25.120
You should be negotiating with me!

02:25.190 --> 02:27.160
Back then, you ordered Xia Jingshi
to kill me.

02:27.160 --> 02:28.210
You owe me a life.

02:28.630 --> 02:29.630
The grudge between us

02:29.630 --> 02:30.760
is far from settled.

02:30.910 --> 02:31.710
Fu Yixiao!

02:32.430 --> 02:34.560
Name your conditions for his release!

02:34.630 --> 02:37.360
Then why don't you find a cliff
and jump off it too?

02:38.190 --> 02:39.050
You don't dare?

02:39.960 --> 02:41.120
Looks like you still can't bear to

02:41.120 --> 02:42.870
part with that worthless life of yours.

02:42.870 --> 02:44.490
Stop pretending to be a filial son.

02:44.490 --> 02:45.690
All that talk of yours

02:45.960 --> 02:47.079
is nothing but an attempt to use

02:47.079 --> 02:49.610
your bond with Feng Suige
to save your father.

02:49.680 --> 02:50.450
Murong Yao.

02:50.910 --> 02:53.640
You're even more hypocritical
than Xia Jingshi.

02:54.160 --> 02:54.960
Feng Suige!

02:55.660 --> 02:57.150
My father once saved your life.

02:57.150 --> 02:58.340
Tell Fu Yixiao to let him go.

02:58.340 --> 03:00.430
What does this have to do with Feng Suige?

03:00.430 --> 03:01.800
This is between us.

03:02.360 --> 03:03.750
If you want to save your father,

03:03.750 --> 03:04.430
you'd better first figure out

03:04.430 --> 03:06.430
how to give me a proper explanation.

03:07.830 --> 03:08.590
Stop him!

03:10.190 --> 03:11.430
If I don't see my father

03:11.430 --> 03:12.630
return safely today,

03:13.070 --> 03:14.470
neither of you can leave!

03:16.150 --> 03:17.310
Elder Marquis Murong's life

03:17.310 --> 03:18.240
is in your hands.

03:18.680 --> 03:20.000
Even for his sake,

03:20.560 --> 03:22.560
you can't afford to act recklessly.

03:22.960 --> 03:23.840
Fu Yixiao!

03:24.800 --> 03:27.060
It seems you don't understand
what I'm capable of.

03:27.060 --> 03:28.840
Stop challenging my limits any further,

03:28.840 --> 03:29.800
or I'll make your lives

03:29.800 --> 03:30.710
worse than death!

03:30.710 --> 03:31.770
It seems you don't understand

03:31.770 --> 03:33.030
what I'm capable of, either.

03:33.030 --> 03:34.150
If I didn't have a backup plan,

03:34.150 --> 03:35.630
would I be here today?

03:36.380 --> 03:37.560
If Feng Suige and I

03:37.560 --> 03:38.760
cannot leave safely,

03:39.030 --> 03:40.090
your father's life

03:40.120 --> 03:41.780
will also be worse than death.

03:42.560 --> 03:44.240
Think carefully about the consequences.

03:44.240 --> 03:46.240
Don't test my patience any further!

03:46.800 --> 03:48.340
Fu Yixiao!

04:08.280 --> 04:15.440
[Rongyang Palace]

04:17.550 --> 04:18.459
Your Highness.

04:25.510 --> 04:26.680
The weather's hot and dry.

04:26.680 --> 04:28.070
Her Majesty the Empress Dowager

04:28.070 --> 04:31.000
had a pot of sour plum drink
prepared for each palace.

04:32.980 --> 04:34.780
I thank Mother for her kindness.

04:36.490 --> 04:38.159
Your Highness need not be so formal.

04:38.159 --> 04:39.950
I figured no one would deliver

04:39.950 --> 04:41.080
to Rongyang Palace,

04:41.159 --> 04:42.560
so I came personally.

04:53.680 --> 04:55.080
If there's nothing else,

04:55.270 --> 04:56.530
I'll take my leave now.

04:57.600 --> 04:59.200
Please take care on your way.

05:20.750 --> 05:22.190
The guards have withdrawn.

05:22.190 --> 05:23.520
Seize the opportunity.

05:44.870 --> 05:45.930
What is this about?

05:54.390 --> 05:56.050
I remember telling you before

05:56.320 --> 05:58.650
that even if you gave up everything
for me,

05:59.070 --> 06:00.800
you could never take her place.

06:08.680 --> 06:09.630
You said you'd grant me

06:09.630 --> 06:10.600
one wish.

06:12.240 --> 06:13.120
I did say that.

06:14.210 --> 06:17.210
But a life of deep affection
and perfect harmony as husband and wife—

06:17.210 --> 06:18.540
that I cannot grant you.

06:19.760 --> 06:21.490
What if it's just for one night?

06:22.950 --> 06:24.270
We're already in Jinxiu.

06:24.270 --> 06:25.160
Now, I'm no longer a princess,

06:25.160 --> 06:26.240
and you're no longer a live-in son-in-law.

06:26.240 --> 06:27.970
We're just an ordinary couple.

06:28.400 --> 06:30.070
Princess, please choose another wish.

06:30.070 --> 06:31.240
This is my only wish!

06:33.659 --> 06:35.260
From the first time I saw you,

06:35.830 --> 06:37.420
you've been my only dream,

06:37.750 --> 06:38.480
and becoming your wife

06:38.480 --> 06:39.880
has been my one true wish.

06:40.310 --> 06:41.800
I never imagined
anyone would win your heart

06:41.800 --> 06:43.070
before I did.

06:43.380 --> 06:46.040
You and I are bound by fate,
yet not meant to be...

06:46.120 --> 06:47.630
But I'm trapped.

06:50.720 --> 06:51.390
Princess.

06:52.430 --> 06:53.159
Listen to me.

06:53.720 --> 06:55.159
I'm the Princess of Susha.

06:55.159 --> 06:56.290
I've lived in luxury

06:56.360 --> 06:58.320
and never experienced hunger or hardship.

06:58.320 --> 06:59.800
But I'm trapped in this obsession

06:59.800 --> 07:01.060
and cannot break free.

07:01.310 --> 07:02.040
My Prince.

07:02.750 --> 07:04.750
Even if we cannot grow old together,

07:05.000 --> 07:05.830
could you just help me

07:05.830 --> 07:06.580
fulfill this one dream,

07:06.580 --> 07:08.530
so that I can accept my fate and let go?

07:08.530 --> 07:10.790
♪ Flying alone ♪

07:11.120 --> 07:14.470
♪ With no need for direction ♪

07:11.890 --> 07:13.750
What will it take for you to let go?

07:16.280 --> 07:18.260
Let me be your true wife—

07:16.430 --> 07:18.770
♪ Flying up to the clouds ♪

07:18.630 --> 07:19.560
even just for one night.

07:18.900 --> 07:21.670
♪ Yet the sun is hiding ♪

07:20.190 --> 07:21.650
Then I'll have no regrets.

07:23.990 --> 07:25.940
♪ Roaming freely ♪

07:26.260 --> 07:29.440
♪ Unafraid of wind or frost ♪

07:31.630 --> 07:33.270
♪ The wet wings ♪

07:33.680 --> 07:37.640
♪ Will carry me far away ♪

07:39.240 --> 07:41.170
Princess, there's nothing I can do

07:41.570 --> 07:42.830
about your obsession.

07:42.930 --> 07:46.250
♪ Don't cry, don't cry ♪

07:48.920 --> 07:53.990
♪ I'll remember the way home ♪

07:57.950 --> 08:01.400
♪ Don't cry, don't cry ♪

08:04.020 --> 08:09.080
♪ I'll find the way home ♪

08:16.190 --> 08:17.560
Elder Marquis is in the village
north of Chongfu Temple,

08:17.560 --> 08:18.820
just outside the city.

08:19.160 --> 08:20.270
I tied him up

08:20.480 --> 08:22.680
and found a farmer's family
to look after him.

08:22.680 --> 08:23.410
Don't worry.

08:23.430 --> 08:24.430
I didn't hurt him.

08:26.340 --> 08:26.690
[Wutong Mansion]

08:42.669 --> 08:43.360
Yun Fang.

08:44.080 --> 08:45.540
Pass on my military order—

08:45.550 --> 08:47.320
summon all soldiers of the Qiongqi Unit

08:47.320 --> 08:49.320
of Feng Battalion to come and see me.

09:38.550 --> 09:39.490
Come on.

09:40.160 --> 09:41.000
I'll take you to see

09:41.000 --> 09:41.970
my divine steed.

09:42.390 --> 09:44.000
I personally captured it

09:44.000 --> 09:45.260
from an enemy general.

09:45.360 --> 09:47.180
Aren't all horses in this world the same?

09:47.180 --> 09:48.270
They just differ in color.

09:48.270 --> 09:49.140
What's there to see?

09:49.140 --> 09:50.480
You'll know once you see it.

09:50.480 --> 09:51.190
Let's go.

09:53.360 --> 09:54.240
What steed in the world

09:54.240 --> 09:56.970
could ever compare to you,
Susha's First Prince?

09:58.120 --> 09:58.720
Hiya!

10:31.790 --> 10:32.390
After you returned,

10:32.390 --> 10:33.590
why didn't you send anyone to rescue us?

10:33.590 --> 10:35.030
Why didn't you plead with His Majesty?

10:35.030 --> 10:36.050
Aren't we best friends?

10:36.050 --> 10:37.850
Where were you when I needed you?

10:39.550 --> 10:41.380
Where were you when I needed you?

10:52.910 --> 10:53.550
Yao.

10:54.790 --> 10:55.440
Yao.

10:56.320 --> 10:57.000
Yao!

11:00.150 --> 11:01.010
Your Highness.

11:01.150 --> 11:02.470
You're finally awake.

11:02.550 --> 11:03.000
Fortunately,

11:03.000 --> 11:05.120
the border patrol soldiers found you.

11:05.120 --> 11:05.850
Where is Yao?

11:05.960 --> 11:07.220
Where is Uncle Murong?

11:07.320 --> 11:08.030
Well...

11:09.360 --> 11:10.510
Your Highness, don't worry.

11:10.510 --> 11:11.910
They've both been saved.

11:12.080 --> 11:13.410
They're safe and sound.

11:14.760 --> 11:17.160
His Majesty even said
he would reward them.

11:17.200 --> 11:18.320
Elder Marquis Murong

11:18.320 --> 11:19.790
is going to guard the northern border

11:19.790 --> 11:22.000
and has already left with His Lordship.

11:26.510 --> 11:27.750
Why should I hate you?

11:28.320 --> 11:29.180
Feng Suige,

11:29.360 --> 11:31.040
it's never you that I hated—

11:31.320 --> 11:32.600
it's my own fate,

11:32.600 --> 11:34.150
and this unjust world!

11:34.480 --> 11:36.410
For once, I want to live for myself.

11:36.720 --> 11:38.050
I want the Murong family

11:38.080 --> 11:39.320
to get what it rightfully deserves.

11:39.320 --> 11:41.250
Is there anything wrong with that?

11:42.340 --> 11:46.470
[Zhuang Residence]

11:46.550 --> 11:48.000
[1 tael of stalactite,
1 tael of red gypsum]

11:48.000 --> 11:50.810
[Half tael of amethyst, half tael of
cinnamon twig with coarse bark removed]

11:48.200 --> 11:49.770
Physician Xu found this prescription

11:49.770 --> 11:51.340
in ancient medical texts.

11:52.440 --> 11:53.290
He's absolutely confident

11:53.290 --> 11:55.020
that it can awaken His Majesty.

11:58.370 --> 11:59.890
Are you truly confident?

12:00.170 --> 12:01.480
This is a serious matter.

12:01.480 --> 12:02.720
You must not speak carelessly.

12:02.720 --> 12:04.030
The pills produced from

12:04.030 --> 12:06.040
this prescription I found

12:06.270 --> 12:08.240
are actually highly toxic.

12:08.550 --> 12:09.480
The medicine actually uses its power

12:09.480 --> 12:11.080
to forcibly stimulate life energy.

12:11.080 --> 12:13.480
Once His Majesty takes it,
he'll surely awaken.

12:13.480 --> 12:14.350
However...

12:16.200 --> 12:18.480
However, it will be like
a fleeting revival.

12:18.480 --> 12:19.740
His life will soon end.

12:21.750 --> 12:22.950
You mean

12:23.550 --> 12:24.860
taking this medicine

12:25.030 --> 12:26.230
means certain death?

12:26.600 --> 12:27.150
Yes.

12:28.240 --> 12:29.480
After waking from this medicine,

12:29.480 --> 12:31.540
he'll live no more than 5 days at most.

12:31.840 --> 12:33.120
By tomorrow morning at the earliest,

12:33.120 --> 12:34.270
I can have

12:34.320 --> 12:35.450
this pill prepared.

12:43.390 --> 12:44.190
Physician Xu.

12:45.240 --> 12:47.200
This matter must never be disclosed.

12:47.200 --> 12:49.400
I don't need to remind you further, do I?

12:49.610 --> 12:50.590
I wouldn't dare.

12:50.620 --> 12:51.870
The lives of my entire family

12:51.870 --> 12:53.510
are in Prime Minister Zhuang's hands.

12:53.510 --> 12:54.960
I would never dare to betray him.

12:54.960 --> 12:58.020
I'll definitely do
as Prime Minister Zhuang commands.

13:07.390 --> 13:08.510
After it's done,

13:09.630 --> 13:11.150
this person cannot be left alive.

13:11.150 --> 13:13.200
Only the dead can keep secrets.

13:14.000 --> 13:15.200
I understand, Uncle.

13:29.490 --> 13:31.390
Miss Yixiao, come here.

13:32.240 --> 13:34.040
What's wrong with His Highness?

13:34.080 --> 13:35.100
I was talking to him just now,

13:35.100 --> 13:36.480
but he ignored me. It feels like

13:36.480 --> 13:38.410
he's radiating murderous intent.

13:40.960 --> 13:42.170
Look, you're not talking either.

13:42.170 --> 13:43.580
What's going on with you both?

13:43.580 --> 13:45.770
He's obviously upset.

13:46.360 --> 13:47.670
When he wants to talk,

13:48.120 --> 13:49.200
he will.

13:49.750 --> 13:50.650
Some things

13:51.360 --> 13:52.270
are better left for him
to tell you himself

13:52.270 --> 13:53.500
when the time comes.

13:54.110 --> 13:55.170
Is it that serious?

13:56.980 --> 13:57.550
Alright then.

13:57.550 --> 13:59.030
I-I won't pursue further then.

13:59.030 --> 14:00.080
At times like this,

14:00.080 --> 14:01.680
I'd better keep my distance.

14:02.160 --> 14:03.370
You'd better not

14:03.820 --> 14:05.550
bring that bad luck upon yourself either.

14:05.550 --> 14:06.310
Be careful.

14:06.360 --> 14:07.290
I'm leaving now.

14:24.600 --> 14:26.200
What are you thinking about?

14:32.510 --> 14:34.310
I'll leave the wine here for you.

14:34.480 --> 14:36.280
I won't disturb you any further.

14:40.280 --> 14:41.910
Why is your name Fu Yixiao?

14:48.280 --> 14:49.230
Didn't you say

14:50.080 --> 14:51.610
you never met your parents?

14:51.950 --> 14:53.480
Then who gave you your name?

14:54.110 --> 14:55.770
Why do you have the surname Fu?

14:56.510 --> 14:58.170
So all that brooding of yours—

14:58.390 --> 15:00.870
turns out this is
what you've been thinking about?

15:00.870 --> 15:02.120
Fu Yixiao.

15:02.960 --> 15:03.910
Commander Fu.

15:04.750 --> 15:05.980
That name of yours sounds like

15:05.980 --> 15:07.530
you're someone's deputy.

15:08.630 --> 15:09.390
Why don't you join

15:09.390 --> 15:10.580
my Feng Battalion?

15:11.000 --> 15:12.400
I'll make you a chief commander.

15:12.400 --> 15:13.750
You can be whatever you want

15:13.750 --> 15:15.750
and take whatever surname you want.

15:16.910 --> 15:18.360
It's already come to this,

15:18.360 --> 15:19.150
why do you still have

15:19.150 --> 15:20.680
so many trivial questions?

15:23.080 --> 15:24.480
Then why do you bother

15:25.240 --> 15:27.300
answering these trivial questions?

15:27.440 --> 15:29.170
Because you're the one asking.

15:40.360 --> 15:41.820
It's only when I'm with you

15:42.790 --> 15:44.720
that I can speak without restraint

15:44.930 --> 15:46.380
and ask whatever I want.

15:49.000 --> 15:50.630
I chose my own name.

15:52.000 --> 15:53.720
It means that
no matter how sad things get,

15:53.720 --> 15:55.110
I can just smile

15:55.270 --> 15:56.270
and forget it all.

15:57.630 --> 15:58.890
Isn't that wonderful?

16:01.240 --> 16:02.120
It is.

16:03.110 --> 16:05.040
You really have forgotten it all.

16:06.000 --> 16:06.670
And here I was,

16:06.670 --> 16:08.200
worrying that you were upset

16:08.200 --> 16:10.130
and thinking of how to comfort you,

16:10.200 --> 16:12.200
yet you're making fun of me instead.

16:12.840 --> 16:14.570
I wish I could forget it all too,

16:20.320 --> 16:21.550
but I can't.

16:22.910 --> 16:24.240
Awake, I'm troubled.

16:24.760 --> 16:26.360
Asleep, I'm still troubled.

16:27.080 --> 16:29.010
You were betrayed by your friends,

16:29.200 --> 16:30.150
yet I've been there by your side,

16:30.150 --> 16:31.720
trying to say something profound

16:31.720 --> 16:32.670
to comfort you.

16:33.120 --> 16:34.550
Now that I think about it,

16:34.550 --> 16:36.350
I must have been quite annoying.

16:36.750 --> 16:37.700
Not at all.

16:38.550 --> 16:39.390
Actually, I wish

16:39.390 --> 16:40.660
I could comfort you

16:40.910 --> 16:42.480
the way you did for me.

16:43.370 --> 16:46.300
♪ Take down the setting sun as my heart ♪

16:46.810 --> 16:50.020
♪ Fold the heaven and earth
to make my wings ♪

16:50.730 --> 16:52.040
♪ If fate shows no mercy ♪

16:52.440 --> 16:53.440
How about I teach you archery?

16:52.480 --> 16:56.020
♪ Then don't blame my recklessness ♪

16:53.860 --> 16:55.030
When I'm shooting arrows,

16:55.030 --> 16:56.120
I become completely focused,

16:56.120 --> 16:57.440
clearing my mind of all distractions,

16:57.440 --> 16:58.890
and naturally letting go of my worries.

16:58.050 --> 17:01.170
♪ I thought in this life
I'd drift like a solitary sail ♪

16:59.510 --> 17:00.710
Would you like to try?

17:01.030 --> 17:03.350
I'm the Commander-in-Chief
of all three armies,

17:01.670 --> 17:04.540
♪ Yet I chanced upon you
in the smoke-filled alleyway ♪

17:03.630 --> 17:05.540
second only to one and above all others,

17:05.380 --> 17:08.160
♪ Like a fleeting flower falling into ♪

17:05.819 --> 17:08.160
with countless master archers
under my command.

17:08.160 --> 17:09.200
Do you really think

17:08.579 --> 17:11.109
♪ My eyes ♪

17:09.200 --> 17:10.589
I need you to teach me archery?

17:10.589 --> 17:12.160
The greatest archer in all of Jinxiu

17:12.160 --> 17:13.310
offering to teach you personally.

17:13.310 --> 17:14.349
It's an opportunity not to be missed.

17:14.349 --> 17:15.810
If you don't want to learn,

17:15.960 --> 17:16.720
forget I mentioned it.

17:16.490 --> 17:18.930
♪ Never thought who'd lay me to rest ♪

17:19.339 --> 17:20.540
♪ Once unstoppable and sharp ♪

17:19.720 --> 17:20.349
Don't go.

17:21.030 --> 17:22.880
♪ Now my heart's tied to you ♪

17:23.790 --> 17:25.900
♪ Thinking of you day and night ♪

17:24.109 --> 17:24.970
I want to learn.

17:28.240 --> 17:30.930
♪ I suddenly realize
ripples are spreading ♪

17:31.300 --> 17:35.370
♪ Melting the frost,
lingering in my heart ♪

17:35.780 --> 17:37.240
♪ The light between your brows ♪

17:37.620 --> 17:39.600
♪ Is the kind of bloom ♪

17:40.180 --> 17:42.370
♪ That I love the most ♪

17:43.650 --> 17:45.970
♪ I truly feel I can forgive it all ♪

17:46.430 --> 17:50.330
♪ The sky's vast and the road's long,
but with you by my side ♪

17:50.680 --> 17:52.430
♪ The twists and turns don't count ♪

17:52.840 --> 17:57.430
♪ I can tell with tears
that I have not lived in vain ♪

17:58.090 --> 18:00.590
♪ Not in vain ♪

18:00.330 --> 18:01.660
Where the arrow points,

18:02.350 --> 18:03.680
the heart follows.

18:06.040 --> 18:07.490
Where the arrow points,

18:08.000 --> 18:09.530
the heart follows.

18:10.110 --> 18:10.910
That's right.

18:11.070 --> 18:12.720
Don't think about anything else.

18:12.720 --> 18:14.200
Just focus on your goal.

18:14.880 --> 18:16.080
There's only one goal

18:17.130 --> 18:18.440
in my heart.

18:21.210 --> 18:22.800
♪ If fate shows no mercy ♪

18:23.260 --> 18:27.080
♪ Then don't blame my recklessness ♪

18:28.630 --> 18:32.050
♪ I thought in this life
I'd drift like a solitary sail ♪

18:32.790 --> 18:35.440
♪ Yet I chanced upon you
in the smoke-filled alleyway ♪

18:33.720 --> 18:34.680
And what is it?

18:35.960 --> 18:38.700
♪ Like a fleeting flower falling into ♪

18:39.250 --> 18:41.800
♪ My eyes ♪

18:42.200 --> 18:44.890
♪ I suddenly realize
ripples are spreading ♪

18:45.260 --> 18:48.970
♪ Melting the frost,
lingering in my heart ♪

18:49.740 --> 18:51.200
♪ The light between your brows ♪

18:51.580 --> 18:53.560
♪ Is the kind of bloom ♪

18:54.140 --> 18:55.830
♪ That I love the most ♪

18:57.190 --> 18:59.630
♪ I truly feel I can forgive it all ♪

19:00.180 --> 19:03.930
♪ The sky's vast and the road's long,
but with you by my side ♪

19:04.330 --> 19:05.920
♪ The twists and turns don't count ♪

19:06.510 --> 19:10.860
♪ I can tell with tears
that I have not lived in vain ♪

19:11.740 --> 19:16.900
♪ Not in vain ♪

19:28.510 --> 19:30.110
You were careless yourself.

19:30.310 --> 19:31.910
It's not like I betrayed you.

19:32.640 --> 19:33.440
Anyway, Feng Suige

19:33.440 --> 19:35.170
would find out sooner or later.

19:36.160 --> 19:38.020
You command the Imperial Guards.

19:38.070 --> 19:39.670
What's there to be afraid of?

19:40.110 --> 19:41.840
But my father is in their hands!

19:42.030 --> 19:42.830
I don't care what plans

19:42.830 --> 19:43.360
you have,

19:43.370 --> 19:44.700
stop them immediately!

19:45.000 --> 19:46.640
If anything happens to Feng Pingcheng,

19:46.640 --> 19:48.350
my father's life will be in danger.

19:48.350 --> 19:49.750
The arrow has left the bow.

19:49.750 --> 19:51.030
How can I stop now?

19:51.510 --> 19:52.710
Besides, your father

19:53.240 --> 19:54.890
neither took part in our plan

19:54.960 --> 19:56.490
nor knew anything about it,

19:56.590 --> 19:58.470
and he even saved Feng Suige's life.

19:58.470 --> 19:59.200
I don't think

19:59.680 --> 20:01.610
Feng Suige would take it out on him.

20:01.920 --> 20:04.650
Are you asking me to gamble
with my father's life?

20:05.790 --> 20:07.190
To achieve great things,

20:07.960 --> 20:09.690
one must take decisive action.

20:11.550 --> 20:13.480
You lost your son and want revenge,

20:15.960 --> 20:16.880
but does that mean

20:16.880 --> 20:18.680
my father's life doesn't count?

20:30.670 --> 20:31.930
What do you want then?

20:32.950 --> 20:34.410
You want us to just stop now

20:34.790 --> 20:36.120
and wait for execution?

20:37.350 --> 20:38.200
I don't care!

20:39.220 --> 20:40.620
Once I get my father back,

20:41.030 --> 20:42.000
you can do whatever you want,

20:42.000 --> 20:43.310
and I absolutely won't stand in your way!

20:43.310 --> 20:44.070
Do you think this is

20:44.070 --> 20:45.550
just kids playing house?

20:54.960 --> 20:56.630
This is not a negotiation.

21:24.960 --> 21:25.940
Your heart

21:26.720 --> 21:28.720
seems to have something to say to me.

21:30.720 --> 21:31.650
What does it say?

21:31.790 --> 21:32.310
Shh.

21:34.400 --> 21:35.800
Let me listen carefully.

21:40.480 --> 21:41.270
It says

21:41.720 --> 21:42.640
it aches,

21:43.720 --> 21:45.580
betrayed by your closest friend.

21:46.200 --> 21:47.240
But it's okay.

21:48.070 --> 21:49.260
It's trying hard

21:49.330 --> 21:50.790
to heal little by little.

21:51.920 --> 21:52.550
Right.

21:54.510 --> 21:56.110
Because I have you by my side.

21:57.400 --> 21:58.380
It also says

21:59.160 --> 22:00.960
it doesn't want to be hurt again.

22:01.480 --> 22:03.070
If anything happens in the future,

22:03.070 --> 22:04.330
just tell me directly.

22:04.880 --> 22:06.340
Don't keep it to yourself.

22:06.920 --> 22:08.790
It doesn't want to be a messenger anymore.

22:08.790 --> 22:09.270
Okay.

22:11.350 --> 22:12.150
I promise you.

22:18.400 --> 22:19.930
But something's not right.

22:20.480 --> 22:21.460
It says

22:22.120 --> 22:23.580
it feels somewhat uneasy,

22:23.750 --> 22:25.830
because you're not telling me the truth.

22:25.830 --> 22:27.560
Nothing gets past you, does it?

22:32.300 --> 22:34.030
I'm worried about His Majesty.

22:34.600 --> 22:35.400
The Imperial Guards are under

22:35.400 --> 22:36.660
Murong Yao's command.

22:37.100 --> 22:39.230
Now that I discovered his true nature,

22:39.920 --> 22:40.750
I'm concerned that the Jinwu Guards

22:40.750 --> 22:42.550
won't be able to
protect His Majesty properly.

22:42.550 --> 22:44.290
So you want to lead your men

22:44.510 --> 22:46.550
into the palace to protect His Majesty?

22:46.550 --> 22:47.850
But if you do that,

22:47.960 --> 22:49.160
you could be framed

22:49.240 --> 22:50.640
for attempting to rebel.

22:50.890 --> 22:52.220
My conscience is clear.

22:52.550 --> 22:54.880
Why should I fear such petty accusations?

22:55.680 --> 22:56.210
Alright.

22:57.550 --> 22:59.280
Since you've made up your mind,

22:59.780 --> 23:00.510
don't worry,

23:01.480 --> 23:02.440
I'll be with you.

23:06.550 --> 23:07.410
Your Highness!

23:15.920 --> 23:16.780
Your Highness.

23:17.550 --> 23:18.310
What's the matter?

23:18.310 --> 23:18.910
Wu Ying...

23:19.590 --> 23:21.300
She bled to death.

23:21.550 --> 23:22.440
She died?

23:25.790 --> 23:26.680
It's a pity that you didn't get to

23:26.680 --> 23:28.410
avenge her with your own hands.

23:28.710 --> 23:29.840
Do you want to go see?

23:31.030 --> 23:31.590
No need.

23:32.190 --> 23:33.720
I don't want to soil my eyes.

23:35.160 --> 23:35.830
Burn her.

23:38.200 --> 23:38.680
Sure.

23:39.440 --> 23:39.920
Sure.

23:48.620 --> 23:51.970
[Zhuang Residence]

24:04.830 --> 24:05.360
Please.

24:05.510 --> 24:06.000
Here.

24:07.000 --> 24:08.070
-Congratulations, Minister.
-Congratulations, Minister.

24:08.070 --> 24:09.110
Thank you.

24:09.590 --> 24:10.300
Thank you.

24:12.620 --> 24:13.150
Father.

24:13.400 --> 24:15.730
I wish you longevity
like the pine and crane,

24:15.730 --> 24:17.990
and fortune greater than the North Star.

24:24.100 --> 24:25.880
Fortune greater than the North Star?

24:25.880 --> 24:27.430
Have you lost your mind?

24:27.670 --> 24:30.060
The North Star represents
the Emperor's position.

24:30.060 --> 24:31.400
Fortunately, there're no outsiders here.

24:31.400 --> 24:32.060
Otherwise,

24:32.350 --> 24:34.040
you'd be guilty of treason.

24:34.510 --> 24:35.030
Father.

24:35.100 --> 24:36.310
Let's not talk about this now.

24:36.310 --> 24:37.110
Didn't I tell you

24:37.110 --> 24:38.630
I prepared a surprise for you?

24:38.630 --> 24:39.500
Let me show you.

24:41.310 --> 24:41.830
Father.

24:42.160 --> 24:42.880
This is the birthday gift

24:42.880 --> 24:44.740
I've carefully prepared for you.

24:45.270 --> 24:46.270
I remember you said

24:46.270 --> 24:47.530
that after turning 55,

24:47.550 --> 24:48.640
you would petition His Majesty

24:48.640 --> 24:50.400
to retire and return to our hometown.

24:50.400 --> 24:52.030
So this past year,
I've been searching diligently

24:52.030 --> 24:52.830
and finally found in Puzhou

24:52.830 --> 24:54.320
the largest fortress.

24:54.480 --> 24:56.270
This fortress has walls 50 feet high

24:56.270 --> 24:57.510
and watchtowers 200 feet tall.

24:57.510 --> 24:58.680
Inside, there're 10 halls, 9 pavilions,

24:58.680 --> 24:59.480
and 300 rooms.

24:59.720 --> 25:00.770
It can accommodate 1,000 horses.

25:00.770 --> 25:01.590
Inside, there's also

25:01.590 --> 25:02.680
a massive granary

25:02.750 --> 25:05.810
that can store enough food
for 1,000 people for 3 years.

25:06.070 --> 25:08.710
Why would I need such a thing?

25:09.110 --> 25:10.180
Father, hold on.

25:10.350 --> 25:11.440
I haven't finished yet.

25:11.440 --> 25:12.830
I've also purchased
the 10,000 acres of farmland

25:12.830 --> 25:13.760
surrounding it,

25:13.920 --> 25:15.550
enough to station 3,000 troops.

25:15.550 --> 25:17.240
You want to maintain a private army?

25:17.240 --> 25:18.790
Are you planning a rebellion?

25:18.790 --> 25:19.960
Why would I rebel?

25:20.160 --> 25:21.070
I just want to give our family

25:21.070 --> 25:22.470
a chance to live freely,

25:22.590 --> 25:24.240
without having to please others.

25:24.240 --> 25:24.700
Father,

25:25.000 --> 25:26.590
you've worked hard your whole life.

25:26.590 --> 25:28.690
It's time to enjoy some peace and comfort.

25:28.690 --> 25:29.910
Don't tell me

25:30.720 --> 25:31.200
you've already started

25:31.200 --> 25:32.860
preparing armor and weapons?

25:33.960 --> 25:35.110
You know me so well, Father.

25:35.110 --> 25:36.070
The designs are ready,

25:36.070 --> 25:36.930
but making them

25:37.000 --> 25:37.660
takes time.

25:38.310 --> 25:39.370
You cannot do this!

25:40.000 --> 25:40.730
But, Father,

25:41.200 --> 25:41.920
you've worked hard your whole life,

25:41.920 --> 25:43.110
toiling for others.

25:43.590 --> 25:44.550
I just wanted to give you

25:44.550 --> 25:46.310
a chance to spend your later years
in peace.

25:46.310 --> 25:47.590
With this fortress in Puzhou,

25:47.590 --> 25:48.760
you can rest easy.

25:48.880 --> 25:49.550
With our doors shut,

25:49.550 --> 25:50.590
even if the King of Heaven himself came,

25:50.590 --> 25:51.550
we wouldn't need to be afraid.

25:51.550 --> 25:53.640
You rose to power together with
His Majesty,

25:53.640 --> 25:54.240
so why

25:54.310 --> 25:55.400
should you worship him

25:55.400 --> 25:56.640
and work day and night for him?

25:56.640 --> 25:58.240
You've really lost your mind!

25:58.240 --> 25:58.830
If anyone finds out,

25:58.830 --> 26:00.160
this is open rebellion!

26:00.790 --> 26:01.680
If I had known you had such

26:01.680 --> 26:02.940
treasonous thoughts,

26:02.960 --> 26:03.680
I should never have

26:03.680 --> 26:05.110
let you go out to gain experience!

26:05.110 --> 26:06.510
Go to Puzhou immediately

26:06.750 --> 26:07.810
and get rid of all these fortresses

26:07.810 --> 26:09.150
and farmhouses at once!

26:13.750 --> 26:14.750
Zhuang Jingheng.

26:15.170 --> 26:16.940
Someone has reported
that you're harboring private troops

26:16.940 --> 26:18.140
with intent to rebel.

26:18.510 --> 26:19.400
Come with us.

26:20.240 --> 26:20.840
Father...

26:30.830 --> 26:31.400
Uncle.

26:32.110 --> 26:34.110
Physician Xu has prepared the pill.

26:46.000 --> 26:47.240
Prepare the carriage.

26:47.240 --> 26:48.700
I'm going into the palace.

26:49.300 --> 26:53.470
[List of Dowry]

26:58.590 --> 27:00.030
That old emperor of Susha

27:00.030 --> 27:01.290
is quite interesting.

27:01.590 --> 27:03.420
His daughter eloped,

27:03.690 --> 27:06.220
yet he arranged for her dowry
to be delivered.

27:06.590 --> 27:09.120
Besides the dowry,

27:09.350 --> 27:10.640
they've also sent

27:10.640 --> 27:12.160
a maid of Princess of Susha.

27:12.160 --> 27:13.100
By rights,

27:13.160 --> 27:14.590
both the maid and the dowry

27:14.590 --> 27:16.200
should be sent to Her Highness.

27:16.200 --> 27:18.640
It's just the Prince of Zhennan
and his wife

27:18.640 --> 27:20.400
are both residing in the palace now,

27:20.400 --> 27:23.980
so I must ask for
Your Majesty's instructions.

27:24.240 --> 27:24.890
Alright.

27:24.920 --> 27:26.320
Just send them to my place

27:27.160 --> 27:29.090
and hand them over to Bai Shouzhuo.

27:30.140 --> 27:32.070
Find accommodation for that maid.

27:32.150 --> 27:33.030
This matter

27:33.350 --> 27:34.160
must absolutely not

27:34.160 --> 27:35.490
be known to anyone else.

27:53.270 --> 27:54.130
Your Highness.

27:54.460 --> 27:57.070
The guards at the gate
have indeed been withdrawn.

27:57.070 --> 27:57.810
Good.

27:58.750 --> 28:01.350
I'll take this opportunity
to go out for a walk.

28:04.390 --> 28:04.990
By the way,

28:05.880 --> 28:06.770
take Princess Xiyang

28:06.770 --> 28:07.770
out for a walk too.

28:07.830 --> 28:09.960
She needs some fresh air
after all these days.

28:09.960 --> 28:10.350
Yes.

28:30.200 --> 28:31.270
You may leave now.

28:31.670 --> 28:32.530
Yes.

29:04.030 --> 29:05.070
The water's cold.

29:20.230 --> 29:21.370
It's still cold.

30:40.030 --> 30:40.720
Feng.

30:42.400 --> 30:43.200
Never thought

30:43.840 --> 30:45.370
you'd see this day, did you?

30:46.830 --> 30:48.270
Lying before me,

30:48.550 --> 30:50.030
completely helpless,

30:50.720 --> 30:52.750
with your life in my hands.

30:54.160 --> 30:55.940
Do you regret

30:57.200 --> 30:59.300
what you said that day

31:00.410 --> 31:01.160
when I knelt before you,

31:01.160 --> 31:02.590
begging you

31:03.720 --> 31:05.110
to spare my son's life?

31:07.640 --> 31:08.970
Prime Minister Zhuang.

31:10.110 --> 31:12.370
You've always been impartial

31:12.480 --> 31:13.800
and strictly fair.

31:13.820 --> 31:15.270
You've never once asked me

31:15.270 --> 31:17.750
for mercy out of personal feelings,

31:17.830 --> 31:19.550
nor bent the law for private gain.

31:19.550 --> 31:20.610
I beg Your Majesty.

31:21.590 --> 31:22.920
He's my only son.

31:23.640 --> 31:27.070
I boldly beg Your Majesty
to spare his life.

31:30.960 --> 31:32.020
Look for yourself.

31:33.200 --> 31:33.960
All these

31:34.880 --> 31:37.440
are memorials denouncing him.

31:38.200 --> 31:39.720
Hiding weapons and private troops

31:39.720 --> 31:40.960
with intent to rebel—

31:41.160 --> 31:43.510
that's the grave crime of treason,

31:44.400 --> 31:46.880
punishable by the extermination
of his entire nine-lineage family.

31:46.880 --> 31:49.400
I've already spared your entire family

31:49.510 --> 31:50.440
out of consideration

31:50.440 --> 31:52.550
for your loyal service.

31:53.110 --> 31:53.900
Zhuang Shen.

31:54.680 --> 31:57.000
You're the Prime Minister of Susha.

31:58.110 --> 31:59.840
If I were to grant your request,

31:59.960 --> 32:01.680
how would I command the respect of all

32:01.680 --> 32:03.880
and face the entire court of officials?

32:03.920 --> 32:05.380
If you were in my position,

32:06.070 --> 32:07.070
what would you do?

32:14.720 --> 32:16.050
I also watched Jingheng

32:16.450 --> 32:18.220
grow up.

32:19.090 --> 32:20.510
Though he committed a grave crime

32:20.510 --> 32:22.350
and cannot be honored
in the ancestral temple,

32:22.350 --> 32:23.550
I'll allow you

32:24.790 --> 32:26.320
to give him a proper burial.

32:26.720 --> 32:28.500
You traded your son

32:29.930 --> 32:32.490
for the peace of my kingdom—

32:34.030 --> 32:34.830
I'll remember

32:36.510 --> 32:37.840
this debt of gratitude.

32:48.880 --> 32:49.400
You said

32:51.460 --> 32:52.750
I traded my son

32:53.790 --> 32:55.900
for the peace of your kingdom,

32:56.270 --> 32:59.130
and you claimed to remember
that debt of gratitude.

33:03.590 --> 33:04.390
I've always

33:05.880 --> 33:07.550
kept that debt in my heart.

33:11.750 --> 33:12.960
13 years.

33:16.230 --> 33:17.510
It's been 13 years!

33:18.070 --> 33:19.000
Not for one day

33:19.000 --> 33:21.330
or even one hour
have I forgotten about it!

33:23.510 --> 33:25.110
Jingheng didn't have to die.

33:25.400 --> 33:27.000
What crime had he committed?

33:28.400 --> 33:29.870
All he did was spend money

33:29.920 --> 33:30.830
to buy a house.

33:31.240 --> 33:32.830
He only slightly overstepped his bounds,

33:32.830 --> 33:34.830
but he didn't actually do anything!

33:36.110 --> 33:37.510
It was all because of you.

33:37.640 --> 33:38.900
It was me you resented!

33:39.110 --> 33:40.670
You blamed me

33:41.270 --> 33:42.790
for the late Empress's death.

33:42.790 --> 33:44.000
But why make Jingheng

33:44.000 --> 33:45.660
suffer for it all?

33:53.200 --> 33:53.790
8 days.

33:55.400 --> 33:56.830
During the 8 days
you've been lying here,

33:56.830 --> 33:58.070
I could've killed you at any moment

33:58.070 --> 33:59.300
to avenge Jingheng!

33:59.960 --> 34:02.240
Even if the Jinwu Guards
killed me afterward,

34:02.240 --> 34:04.590
it would only be a life for a life!

34:11.920 --> 34:13.030
What's the worth

34:15.800 --> 34:17.530
of this old life of mine anyway?

34:20.590 --> 34:21.670
But I won't let you

34:21.670 --> 34:22.920
die so easily.

34:23.840 --> 34:25.110
I want you to watch

34:25.150 --> 34:26.880
your son die with your own eyes.

34:27.760 --> 34:29.190
I want you to feel

34:29.280 --> 34:31.340
the agony of losing a child yourself!

34:34.510 --> 34:36.239
I've prepared the pill for you.

34:37.510 --> 34:39.230
As soon as I catch Feng Suige,

34:40.710 --> 34:42.310
I'll make you take this pill.

34:42.510 --> 34:43.840
This is a miraculous pill.

34:43.840 --> 34:44.770
Once you take it,

34:45.280 --> 34:47.230
you'll immediately regain consciousness,

34:47.230 --> 34:49.150
so you can see your son die
right before your eyes

34:49.150 --> 34:50.440
in a sober state!

34:52.710 --> 34:54.110
Unfortunately, though.

34:55.590 --> 34:57.850
Unfortunately, this pill is poisonous.

34:58.000 --> 34:59.030
After you take it,

34:59.400 --> 35:00.800
you'll die within 5 days.

35:01.800 --> 35:03.710
How I wish you wouldn't die.

35:04.510 --> 35:06.310
I wish you could suffer as I have,

35:10.510 --> 35:13.370
enduring the pain of losing your child
for 13 years!

35:14.030 --> 35:16.000
Only that would be fair!

35:28.510 --> 35:29.190
Today is

35:29.190 --> 35:30.850
the last time I came to see you.

35:31.030 --> 35:33.070
These words have been hidden in my heart

35:33.070 --> 35:34.030
for too long,

35:35.550 --> 35:37.150
and I had to say them out loud.

35:37.360 --> 35:38.290
It's just a shame

35:40.150 --> 35:41.590
that you can't hear me.

35:43.800 --> 35:45.440
You old bastard,

35:47.440 --> 35:49.150
still luckier than I am.

36:16.150 --> 36:16.670
Yesterday, when they

36:16.670 --> 36:18.190
returned to Zhengnian Villa,

36:18.190 --> 36:18.880
Fang asked

36:18.880 --> 36:20.210
when Master would come.

36:20.930 --> 36:21.320
I wonder

36:21.320 --> 36:22.850
if they've settled in well.

36:23.000 --> 36:24.210
Don't worry, My Lady.

36:24.280 --> 36:25.670
They're all very sensible.

36:25.670 --> 36:26.760
They understand that Miss Yixiao

36:26.760 --> 36:28.510
has important matters to attend to.

36:28.510 --> 36:29.110
I asked Mr. Qin

36:29.110 --> 36:30.440
to hire a tutor for them,

36:30.510 --> 36:31.230
and they've agreed

36:31.230 --> 36:32.890
to settle down here properly.

36:33.760 --> 36:34.570
That's good.

36:35.710 --> 36:37.150
This is Physician Hou's prescription.

36:37.150 --> 36:38.150
Instruct someone

36:38.150 --> 36:40.000
to give him medicine on time every day.

36:40.000 --> 36:41.070
He's out of danger now.

36:41.070 --> 36:42.530
He'll wake up in a few days.

36:42.630 --> 36:43.070
Got it.

36:43.810 --> 36:44.410
By the way,

36:44.840 --> 36:46.470
go help me pack a few things.

36:46.550 --> 36:48.080
I'm going on a long journey.

36:48.360 --> 36:49.030
My Lady, you...

36:49.030 --> 36:50.510
You're not going to that

36:50.630 --> 36:52.960
so-called mysterious place, are you?

36:53.280 --> 36:53.810
Yes, I am.

36:54.000 --> 36:55.340
I promised Sister.

36:55.920 --> 36:57.500
Still no news of Ning Fei?

36:58.880 --> 36:59.720
Don't worry.

36:59.760 --> 37:01.230
I pestered my father for information.

37:01.230 --> 37:02.280
The place where Ning Fei was sent

37:02.280 --> 37:03.480
is called the Storm Alliance.

37:03.480 --> 37:04.190
My father said

37:04.190 --> 37:05.710
those of the Storm Alliance
are very skilled.

37:05.710 --> 37:08.310
They'll definitely be able to
revive Ning Fei.

37:08.840 --> 37:09.550
Rest assured.

37:09.550 --> 37:10.730
Once I return to Zhengnian Villa

37:10.730 --> 37:12.360
and get Fang and the others settled,

37:12.360 --> 37:13.960
I'll go visit the Storm Alliance in person

37:13.960 --> 37:15.560
and check on Ning Fei for you.

37:19.280 --> 37:19.920
So do you know

37:19.920 --> 37:21.520
where the Storm Alliance is?

37:21.960 --> 37:22.670
Of course.

37:23.110 --> 37:24.110
My father knows all too well

37:24.110 --> 37:24.880
how I can never stop digging

37:24.880 --> 37:26.110
once I start asking questions.

37:26.110 --> 37:27.350
I kept pestering him,

37:27.550 --> 37:28.750
so he finally told me.

37:28.920 --> 37:29.450
But wait.

37:30.190 --> 37:31.070
Master sent a letter

37:31.070 --> 37:32.280
instructing Mr. Qin

37:32.400 --> 37:33.400
to watch over you, My Lady,

37:33.400 --> 37:34.860
and not let you wander off.

37:35.070 --> 37:35.940
Eleven.

37:36.320 --> 37:38.580
You just be good and stay here, all right?

37:39.000 --> 37:39.710
I...

37:42.320 --> 37:45.870
[Linfang Hall]

37:57.030 --> 37:58.350
A life of deep affection

37:58.350 --> 38:00.550
and perfect harmony as husband and wife—

38:00.550 --> 38:01.880
that I cannot grant you.

38:02.710 --> 38:04.550
Princess, there's nothing I can do

38:04.550 --> 38:05.810
about your obsession.

38:49.710 --> 38:51.170
Greetings, Your Majesty.

38:53.000 --> 38:55.190
Princess, did you personally
pick these flowers

38:55.190 --> 38:56.650
for the Prince of Zhennan?

38:58.030 --> 38:59.920
Such touching devotion.

39:02.070 --> 39:03.600
Unfortunately, my brother

39:03.760 --> 39:04.810
is too stubborn.

39:05.150 --> 39:06.460
Once he's made up his mind,

39:06.460 --> 39:08.210
it's nearly impossible to change it.

39:08.210 --> 39:09.220
No one else knows this,

39:09.220 --> 39:09.710
but I

39:09.960 --> 39:11.560
am the one who knows him best.

39:11.760 --> 39:13.380
What do you mean by that, Your Majesty?

39:13.380 --> 39:14.320
After all, I've been

39:14.320 --> 39:15.980
his brother for so many years.

39:16.360 --> 39:17.960
Back then, I beat him, scolded him,

39:17.960 --> 39:19.550
imprisoned him in the imperial jail,

39:19.550 --> 39:21.950
yet he still refused to
admit his mistakes.

39:21.960 --> 39:23.960
That's just the kind of person he is.

39:26.280 --> 39:27.750
I'm feeling unwell

39:28.060 --> 39:29.320
and must take my leave.

39:30.320 --> 39:31.920
Are you leaving the flowers?

39:35.400 --> 39:36.590
Giving such beautiful flowers

39:36.590 --> 39:37.110
to my

39:37.110 --> 39:38.030
romantically clueless brother

39:38.030 --> 39:39.190
would be such a waste.

39:39.190 --> 39:42.390
Fresh blooms are meant to
be paired with beautiful women.

39:43.710 --> 39:45.310
If His Highness enjoys them,

39:45.400 --> 39:46.760
then they won't be wasted.

39:46.760 --> 39:49.000
Too bad he doesn't know
how to cherish beauty.

39:49.000 --> 39:49.730
If I were him,

39:50.360 --> 39:51.670
I wouldn't let a beauty

39:51.710 --> 39:53.440
stand here brooding all alone.

39:56.150 --> 39:58.750
Please show some self-respect,
Your Majesty!

40:05.840 --> 40:06.630
This is the first time

40:06.630 --> 40:08.560
anyone dares to treat me like that.

40:09.510 --> 40:10.320
Interesting.

40:39.550 --> 40:41.750
His Highness is waiting for you inside.

40:43.760 --> 40:45.000
His Highness's instruction:

40:45.000 --> 40:46.280
everyone, eat first!

40:47.360 --> 40:48.030
Yes!

40:53.920 --> 40:55.000
What has His Highness summoned

40:55.000 --> 40:56.150
the Qiongqi Unit here for?

40:56.150 --> 40:57.670
These are a bunch of lunatics.

40:57.670 --> 40:58.590
Every single one of them

40:58.590 --> 41:00.520
has dozens of lives on their hands.

41:01.440 --> 41:02.000
Yun Qing.

41:02.480 --> 41:03.640
Give them a heads-up

41:03.840 --> 41:04.590
that when they meet Miss Yixiao,

41:04.590 --> 41:05.990
they must not act rashly.

41:10.670 --> 41:11.530
Your Highness.

41:11.670 --> 41:12.510
You want the Qiongqi Unit
to enter the palace

41:12.510 --> 41:13.320
to protect His Majesty?

41:13.320 --> 41:14.120
That's right.

41:14.480 --> 41:16.360
They'll enter as my household guards,

41:16.360 --> 41:17.490
with no waist tokens

41:17.960 --> 41:18.800
and no armor.

41:19.550 --> 41:20.320
This is the only plan

41:20.320 --> 41:21.650
we can think of right now

41:21.880 --> 41:22.510
that won't give anyone leverage

41:22.510 --> 41:23.550
against us.

41:23.960 --> 41:25.360
If soldiers of the Feng Battalion
were to appear

41:25.360 --> 41:26.550
to protect His Majesty,

41:26.550 --> 41:27.400
people would suspect

41:27.400 --> 41:28.920
the First Prince of plotting rebellion.

41:28.920 --> 41:29.610
Then

41:29.840 --> 41:31.070
Prime Minister Zhuang
would mobilize troops

41:31.070 --> 41:32.630
to surround the Feng Battalion.

41:32.630 --> 41:33.320
So our only option is

41:33.320 --> 41:34.400
to achieve great effect with little force—

41:34.400 --> 41:35.230
enter the palace as household guards

41:35.230 --> 41:36.440
to protect His Majesty

41:36.440 --> 41:37.480
until he wakes up.

41:57.070 --> 41:57.930
Your Highness.

41:58.630 --> 41:59.760
This is Fu Yixiao,

42:00.840 --> 42:02.320
Jinxiu's finest archer.

42:07.480 --> 42:08.840
She's one of our own now.

42:10.670 --> 42:12.280
Your Highness, you summoned us.

42:12.280 --> 42:13.320
Who do you want us to deal with?

42:13.320 --> 42:15.550
Come with me to enter the palace
to protect His Majesty.

42:15.550 --> 42:17.030
If anyone threatens His Majesty,

42:17.030 --> 42:18.190
no matter who they are,

42:18.190 --> 42:19.920
kill them without hesitation.

42:19.920 --> 42:21.360
As you command, Your Highness.

42:21.360 --> 42:22.360
Whoever Your Highness wants dealt with,

42:22.360 --> 42:23.690
we'll take care of them.

42:24.480 --> 42:25.670
You just need to take your men

42:25.670 --> 42:27.230
and guard outside His Majesty's chambers.

42:27.230 --> 42:27.920
I'll assist you.

42:27.920 --> 42:29.030
When we work,

42:29.070 --> 42:30.670
we don't need anyone's help.

42:30.670 --> 42:31.930
After I finish the job,

42:32.360 --> 42:34.020
I'll challenge you to a match.

42:34.070 --> 42:34.840
Anytime.

42:35.150 --> 42:35.750
Very well.

42:37.150 --> 42:39.230
Keep your mouth shut
if you don't want trouble.

42:39.230 --> 42:40.960
From now on, what Fu Yixiao says

42:41.400 --> 42:43.510
represents my will.

42:50.180 --> 42:52.280
To work alongside the famous Fu Yixiao

42:52.280 --> 42:53.670
and fight enemies together

42:53.670 --> 42:55.960
is my greatest honor.

42:56.880 --> 42:57.610
Don't worry.

42:57.630 --> 42:59.360
You won't need to lift a finger.

42:59.510 --> 43:00.710
Those Imperial Guards

43:00.710 --> 43:02.590
live on meager rations.

43:02.920 --> 43:04.250
They're all weaklings.

43:04.480 --> 43:05.440
All the better.

43:39.150 --> 43:40.840
After finishing your meal, get changed

43:40.840 --> 43:41.920
and get ready to go.

43:42.400 --> 43:43.230
Yes!
